2. server responds result {protocolVersion, capabilities, serverInfo}
3. send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"} 
4. send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list"}
5. for each tool call: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":N,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"fitness_check","arguments":{"repo": "/path"}}}

